      "content": "i know i should probably go but the clinic is miles away and i cant afford the co-pay right now. i already checked the bottle and the macrobid isnt even expired. i feel like i know my body... like, how much of it can i safely take just to get through the weekend until i can make an appointment? like what's the normal dose for an adult?",
